Two files are substantially upstream's, and carry Omarchy's copyright:

  Bar.qml      $OMARCHY_PATH/shell/plugins/bar/Bar.qml
  BarModel.js  $OMARCHY_PATH/shell/plugins/bar/BarModel.js

where $OMARCHY_PATH is /usr/share/omarchy on a standard install.

Every change made here is marked in Bar.qml with a comment beginning
`nagualcode.toptop`, so the diff against a fresh upstream copy is the whole
story:

  git diff --no-index /usr/share/omarchy/shell/plugins/bar/Bar.qml Bar.qml

